<title>GREECE: Bank/Greece drains 200bln drs at avg 11.95pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Greece drains 200bln drs at avg 11.95pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Greece soaked up 200 billion drachmas of 14-day depo funds at an average rate of 11.95 percent in today's tender, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The minimum accepted interest rate was 11.78 percent and the maximum interest rate was 11.97 percent.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
